			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">Mr. Smith owns 1,122,946 shares of our Common Stock and stock options to purchase 10,000 shares of Common Stock at an exercise price of $11.60 per share, which expire on November 10, 2027, which have vested as of the Record Date. Mr. Smith's ownership of 1,122,946 shares includes 719,613 fully vested shares and 113,333 shares which are subject to vesting at the rate of 1/2 of such shares on each of March 19, 2026 and 2027; and 300,000 shares which are subject to vesting at the rate of 1/3&#160;of such shares on each of February 14, 2027, 2028, and 2029. All unvested shares are also subject to Mr. Smith's continued service to the Company on the date of the vesting of such shares.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

