			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">As described in Footnote (10) below, Mr. King is the Chief Executive Officer and 100% owner of King Oil &amp; Gas Company Inc, and as a result, has the right to vote and to dispose of the 2,359,728 shares of Common Stock of the Company held by King Oil &amp; Gas Company, Inc. Mr. King's ownership also includes 193,913 fully vested shares.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;">

