<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b><a id="OutstandingEquityAwards" title="OutstandingEquityAwards" href="#"></a>Outstanding Equity Awards at Fiscal Year-End</b></p>

