			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">An annual cash payment payable to the Chairperson of (a) the Audit Committee of $25,000; (b) the Compensation Committee of $16,000; and (c) the Nominating&#160;Committee of $16,000; and</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

