			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">Long-term equity grants of shares of Common Stock or stock options of the Company, issuable to each member of the Board of Directors and the Chairman of the Board of Directors.</p>
